    "%lld %@": {
      "comment": "A horizontal stack displaying two vertical stacks. The first stack contains a label \"Цель\" and the challenge's target count with the corresponding type. The second stack contains a label \"Участников\" and the count of currently joined participants. Both stacks are centered and have a title size of 24 with a bold font. There is a 30-point spacing between them.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
